The most impressive part of Quarto was learning that I can combine writing, R code, charts, and results in one document. I also liked that the same file can be rendered into formats such as HTML, PDF, Word, or presentations.[^1] The Visual mode feels similar to Microsoft Word, while Source mode gives me more control over the formatting.

